      "cpp": "NCollection_UBTreeFiller<T,B>::Fill virtual myTree.Add(aObjBnd.myObj,aObjBnd.myBnd), and destructor Fill dispatch",
      "rust": "UBTree/EBTree::native_insertion -> NativeBoundingTree implementing existing BoundingTreeInsertion -> unchanged UBTreeFiller::fill/Drop -> UBTree::add_ref or EBTree::add_native_ref",
      "domain": "B:BoundingVolume+Default native tree construction capability selected by explicit borrowed wrapper. Existing filler constructor, queue representation, random generator and Drop implementation are unchanged. NativeBoundingTree/native_insertion are Rust adapter APIs, not invented C++ declarations credited as ported."
